  "description": "TUnit-native OpenTelemetry distributed-tracing (Activity / span) assertions for .NET tests: fluent Assert.That(span) entry points for operation name, tags, status, kind, events, duration, child spans, and parent/child, root and same-trace relationships, plus Assert.That(capture) checks for span presence, count and lookup by tag (the lookup returns the span). Span capture is a raw ActivityListener over an ActivitySource. Builds on the TracingAssertions framework-agnostic core. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection in the assertion path, and no NuGet dependencies beyond TUnit and the TracingAssertions core.",
  "id": "TracingAssertions.TUnit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T17:52:30.64Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
